{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3df7ed1cb2bfe86b5a7731584b4543171a0c2a5b7a8d7a1352e5108e3ddc31fa","ja":"やよいちゃん、おめでとうございます～。","zh":"小弥生，恭喜你～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b8d0187f837a8f78ce5e541df8ced68fd993d3bec7b48ed7d89db36e5434dcee","ja":"ありがとうございまーすっ！　MVPは取れなかった\nですけど、『パン食い競争』は一等賞でした！","zh":"谢谢大家——！虽然没能拿到MVP\n但是，『吃面包比赛』获得了一等奖！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"581032aed4b452ef1bf349795a18e81642b8f23e6354c7cf0601bbb4508ebc9f","ja":"一等賞でもギフト券がもらえて、うれしいですっ！\nこれで『セカキュー』のグッズが買えますよねっ！","zh":"一等奖也能拿到礼品券，好开心！\n这样就能买『セカキュー』的周边了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4a928d3030b4432469099662ffe0790ac5048402720be2d7ce0729926368252c","ja":"買い物のガイドは、私に任せてくださいね。","zh":"购物指南就交给我吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"abe067b1e2a650bb1af60be743e948c62fdbaeacd063536d9b4dcf3f8c2f52c5","ja":"さすが百合子ちゃん、頼もしいね♪","zh":"不愧是百合子，真可靠呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"70368dc209a1959165b6aef4e241c3c341ed890261f853dcd607df141ef77131","ja":"えへへ……ではさっそくこちらのお店に入りましょう！\n乙女ゲーム関連の品揃えがものすごいんですよっ！","zh":"嘿嘿……那我们赶紧进这家店吧！\n这家店的乙女游戏相关商品种类超级丰富哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7b3a92aeccf88b06af678b32646d24525d9b59757df8a9040aec910a1cd5ab3e","ja":"わあっ、『セカキュー』グッズがたくさんあります！\nアクリルスタンドとか、ポスターとかっ！","zh":"哇，有好多『セカキュー』周边！\n亚克力立牌、海报什么的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"cc9ca962a197be24bc617a5f7af2903b6d4a17e84498afdba4727859d13879e6","ja":"そうですね～。\nラバーストラップとか、身に着けるものまで……。","zh":"说得也是呢～。\n橡胶挂件之类的，连穿戴的东西都……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"393c291d532d2808d54b67e1d630daf1a6850508d2a9494d6de505d4cd0b65bd","ja":"うふふ、敬意の対象を常に近くに置いておきたい心理\n……私にも覚えがあります～。敬われる方ですが～。","zh":"呵呵，总想把尊敬的对象放在身边的心理\n……我也深有体会呢～。不过我是被尊敬的那一方啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d67833647dd8480f4a7a3e56b756f9bee3c3bc05960853b7fe9ce705ad4d3fe0","ja":"私たちのアイドルグッズも、\nた～くさん作ってもらってますもんね！","zh":"我们的偶像周边也，\n做了好多呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"6a7b2095af5a11d8f661e05053db2dc7fba6db38ac9076b579e14920a45241a3","ja":"はい～。ですが『セカキュー』グッズも、\nなかなかのラインナップですね～。","zh":"是的～。不过『セカキュー』周边也，\n阵容相当不错呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"17c4de786f094a7241b6b7e50ff673a19692f2f2fe15bc91ad8b516efca374f5","ja":"本当に、想像してた以上です！\nお金がいくらあっても足りませんっ！","zh":"真的，比想象的还要多！\n钱再多也不够！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"b676536cab3258378e87ba96207a3691d1b2b27d37935c8c53672c9575083acd","ja":"ふふっ、百合子ちゃんすごく真剣に選んでるね。\nでもわかるなあ、私も迷っちゃって……。","zh":"呵呵，小百合子选得超级认真呢。\n不过我也懂，我自己也犹豫了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"217015ddfa41a70bd1ee90eb8ae7223cadf5fa84cdc20c19b4c8874b348a662f","ja":"やよいちゃんは決まりそう？","zh":"小やよい定了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"dd181ff11ad43851e3d1fb8b6e18ccd199c7b6499d145c7f99632c82232b46d1","ja":"迷います……レオナルドさんの缶バッジも\nポストカードも、すっごくステキで……！","zh":"好纠结……莱昂纳多的徽章\n和明信片都超级棒……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"1e365d9400e2a188f8c5abe600316a7f969cb73096958fbc50ad85a445de739c","ja":"時間はいっぱいありますから、\nゆっくり選ぶといいですよ～。","zh":"时间还很充裕，\n慢慢挑选就好啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1012.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"5e239c08613c361eb9b0a1e854afb9011ac3a552f364b116113876d9df46a1e7","ja":"はいっ！　えーっと……これもいいし、\nでも、こっちも……うーん、うーん……！","zh":"好！　那个……这个也挺好，\n不过，这个也……唔，唔……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
